{"id":"skeuomorphism-classic","title":"Skeuomorphism — Classic Notes","description":"The 2010 iOS-era look — linen textures, a yellow legal-pad note with a push pin and red margin line, glossy aqua buttons and heavy soft shadows. The missing era between Web 2.0 and flat design.","tags":["skeuomorphism","notes","classic"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T19:10:09.962Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Skeuomorphism — Classic Notes\ndescription: The 2010 iOS-era look — linen textures, a yellow legal-pad note with a push pin and red margin line, glossy aqua buttons and heavy soft shadows. The missing era between Web 2.0 and flat design.\ntags: [skeuomorphism, notes, classic]\norder: 16\n---\n\n# Skeuomorphism — Classic Notes\n\nWhen interfaces imitated real objects: a linen desk, a paper pad held by a push pin,\nbuttons with glass highlights. This working notes app recreates the 2010 aesthetic with\npure CSS — the paper even has real ruled lines you can write on.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Desk | linen — `#b8c2d0` with 45° crosshatch gradients |\n| Top bar | dark gloss `#4a5a75 → #2f3b50` + inset highlight |\n| Paper | `#fdf9c4` legal pad, ruled lines every 28px, red margin at 56px |\n| Pin | glossy red hemisphere with highlight |\n| Buttons | aqua gloss `#8ab4e8 → #2c5590`, inset top shine |\n| Type | Marker Felt / Comic Sans for handwriting, system for UI |\n\n## Interaction\n\nFully working notes app: pick a note from the list, write directly on the pad\n(contenteditable), add new notes, delete them — everything persists in localStorage\nwith a live word count.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Skeuomorphism — Classic Notes\n\nWhen interfaces imitated real objects: a linen desk, a paper pad held by a push pin,\nbuttons with glass highlights. This working notes app recreates the 2010 aesthetic with\npure CSS — the paper even has real ruled lines you can write on.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Desk | linen — `#b8c2d0` with 45° crosshatch gradients |\n| Top bar | dark gloss `#4a5a75 → #2f3b50` + inset highlight |\n| Paper | `#fdf9c4` legal pad, ruled lines every 28px, red margin at 56px |\n| Pin | glossy red hemisphere with highlight |\n| Buttons | aqua gloss `#8ab4e8 → #2c5590`, inset top shine |\n| Type | Marker Felt / Comic Sans for handwriting, system for UI |\n\n## Interaction\n\nFully working notes app: pick a note from the list, write directly on the pad\n(contenteditable), add new notes, delete them — everything persists in localStorage\nwith a live word count.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Notes — Skeuomorphism\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #b8c2d0;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);\n    min-height: 100vh; padding: 26px 16px 46px;\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .app { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.55), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.6); }\n\n  /* dark gloss title bar */\n  .topbar { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5a6c8c, #39485f 50%, #2c3a4e);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); padding: 12px 16px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .topbar .title { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }\n  .topbar .title small { font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.7; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; margin-left: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  .gloss { border: 1px solid #1d3c66; border-radius: 14px; color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;\n    text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); cursor: pointer; padding: 7px 16px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8ab4e8, #3968a5 50%, #2c5590);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55), 0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); }\n  .gloss:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9cc4f2, #4272ae 50%, #35619c); }\n  .gloss:active { box-shadow: inset 0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); }\n  .gloss.red { border-color: #7a1f1f; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f09a9a, #c0392b 50%, #96281b); }\n  .gloss.red:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7adad, #d24437 50%, #a52f22); }\n\n  .cols { display: flex; min-height: 540px; }\n\n  /* linen list panel */\n  .list { width: 250px; flex: none; background-color: #97a5b8;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);\n    box-shadow: inset -14px 0 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22), inset 2px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n    padding: 14px 12px; overflow-y: auto; }\n  .note-item { border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 12px; margin-bottom: 7px; cursor: pointer;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08));\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.35); }\n  .note-item .t { color: #1f2c40; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }\n  .note-item .d { color: #43536b; font-size: 10.5px; margin-top: 1px; }\n  .note-item.sel { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8ab4e8, #3968a5); border-color: #1d3c66; }\n  .note-item.sel .t { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); }\n  .note-item.sel .d { color: #cfe2f8; }\n\n  /* the legal pad */\n  .padwrap { flex: 1; padding: 34px 34px 26px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); }\n  .pad { width: 100%; max-width: 520px; min-height: 460px; position: relative; transform: rotate(-0.5deg);\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0 27px, #aacbe8 27px 28px), #fdf9c4;\n    border-radius: 3px 10px 10px 3px;\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.5), 0 2px 0 #d9c46a, 0 3px 0 #cbb558, 4px 0 0 #e8dfae;\n    padding: 34px 28px 40px 72px; }\n  .pad::before { /* red margin line */\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 52px; width: 1px;\n    background: #e08a8a; box-shadow: 2px 0 0 #e08a8a; }\n  .pad::after { /* stitching */\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 7px; border: 1.5px dashed rgba(160, 140, 60, 0.55); border-radius: 3px; pointer-events: none; }\n  .pin { position: absolute; top: -13px; left: 50%; margin-left: -16px; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, #ff9d9d, #d02f2f 55%, #8f1414);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 10px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.5), inset 0 -3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .pad .date { position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 22px; font-size: 11px; color: #a59a5c; font-style: italic; }\n  .writing { font-family: \"Marker Felt\", \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", cursive; color: #2b3a55;\n    font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; min-height: 380px; outline: none; caret-color: #d02f2f; }\n  .writing:empty::before { content: \"Write something…\"; color: #b3ab7a; }\n  .wordcount { text-align: right; font-size: 10.5px; color: #a59a5c; font-style: italic; padding: 8px 4px 0; }\n\n  .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 16px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14); border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"app\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"topbar\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"title\">Notes \u003csmall>Local Storage Edition\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"gloss\" id=\"newBtn\">＋ New Note\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cols\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"list\" id=\"list\">\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"padwrap\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pad\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"pin\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"date\" id=\"padDate\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"writing\" id=\"writing\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"wordcount\" id=\"wc\">0 words\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"toolbar\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"gloss red\" id=\"delBtn\">🗑 Delete Note\u003c/button>\n      \u003cspan style=\"color:#cfd9e8;font-size:11px;margin-left:auto;opacity:0.8\">Notes are saved in your browser automatically\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const KEY = \"skeuo.notes\";\n    let notes, sel;\n    try { notes = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY) || \"null\") || null; } catch (e) { notes = null; }\n    if (!notes) {\n      notes = [\n        { id: 1, t: \"Grocery list\", d: \"2026-10-10\", b: \"pick up after work:\u003cbr>• milk\u003cbr>• bread\u003cbr>• gummy frogs (important)\" },\n        { id: 2, t: \"Design ideas\", d: \"2026-10-11\", b: \"what if buttons looked like REAL buttons?\u003cbr>\u003cbr>• gloss highlights\u003cbr>• pixel-perfect bevels\u003cbr>• shadows you can feel\" }\n      ];\n      sel = 1;\n    } else { sel = notes[0].id; }\n    function save() { try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(notes)); } catch (e) {} }\n    function fmtDate(s) { const d = new Date(s); return isNaN(d) ? s : d.toDateString().slice(4); }\n\n    const list = document.getElementById(\"list\"), writing = document.getElementById(\"writing\");\n    function render() {\n      document.getElementById(\"list\").innerHTML = notes.map(n =>\n        '\u003cdiv class=\"note-item' + (n.id === sel ? \" sel\" : \"\") + '\" data-id=\"' + n.id + '\">' +\n        '\u003cdiv class=\"t\">' + n.t + \"\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\" + '\"d\">' + fmtDate(n.d) + \"\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\").join(\"\");\n      const note = notes.find(n => n.id === sel);\n      writing.innerHTML = note ? note.b : \"\";\n      document.getElementById(\"padDate\").textContent = note ? fmtDate(note.d) : \"\";\n      wc();\n      list.querySelectorAll(\".note-item\").forEach(el => el.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        sel = +el.dataset.id; save(); render();\n      }));\n    }\n    function wc() {\n      const words = (writing.textContent.trim().match(/\\S+/g) || []).length;\n      document.getElementById(\"wc\").textContent = words + (words === 1 ? \" word\" : \" words\");\n    }\n    writing.addEventListener(\"input\", () => {\n      const note = notes.find(n => n.id === sel);\n      if (!note) return;\n      note.b = writing.innerHTML;\n      note.t = (writing.textContent.trim().split(\"\\n\")[0] || \"New Note\").slice(0, 32);\n      note.d = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n      save();\n      const item = list.querySelector('.note-item[data-id=\"' + sel + '\"] .t');\n      if (item) item.textContent = note.t;\n      wc();\n    });\n    document.getElementById(\"newBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      const id = Date.now();\n      notes.unshift({ id: id, t: \"New Note\", d: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10), b: \"\" });\n      sel = id; save(); render(); writing.focus();\n    });\n    document.getElementById(\"delBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (!confirm(\"Delete this note?\")) return;\n      notes = notes.filter(n => n.id !== sel);\n      sel = notes.length ? notes[0].id : null;\n      if (!notes.length) notes = [{ id: Date.now(), t: \"New Note\", d: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10), b: \"\" }], sel = notes[0].id;\n      save(); render();\n    });\n    document.getElementById(\"padDate\").textContent = new Date().toDateString().slice(4);\n    render();\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Notes — Skeuomorphism\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #b8c2d0;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);\n    min-height: 100vh; padding: 26px 16px 46px;\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .app { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.55), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.6); }\n\n  /* dark gloss title bar */\n  .topbar { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5a6c8c, #39485f 50%, #2c3a4e);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); padding: 12px 16px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .topbar .title { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }\n  .topbar .title small { font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.7; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; margin-left: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  .gloss { border: 1px solid #1d3c66; border-radius: 14px; color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;\n    text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); cursor: pointer; padding: 7px 16px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8ab4e8, #3968a5 50%, #2c5590);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55), 0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); }\n  .gloss:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9cc4f2, #4272ae 50%, #35619c); }\n  .gloss:active { box-shadow: inset 0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); }\n  .gloss.red { border-color: #7a1f1f; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f09a9a, #c0392b 50%, #96281b); }\n  .gloss.red:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7adad, #d24437 50%, #a52f22); }\n\n  .cols { display: flex; min-height: 540px; }\n\n  /* linen list panel */\n  .list { width: 250px; flex: none; background-color: #97a5b8;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);\n    box-shadow: inset -14px 0 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22), inset 2px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n    padding: 14px 12px; overflow-y: auto; }\n  .note-item { border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 12px; margin-bottom: 7px; cursor: pointer;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08));\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.35); }\n  .note-item .t { color: #1f2c40; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }\n  .note-item .d { color: #43536b; font-size: 10.5px; margin-top: 1px; }\n  .note-item.sel { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8ab4e8, #3968a5); border-color: #1d3c66; }\n  .note-item.sel .t { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); }\n  .note-item.sel .d { color: #cfe2f8; }\n\n  /* the legal pad */\n  .padwrap { flex: 1; padding: 34px 34px 26px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); }\n  .pad { width: 100%; max-width: 520px; min-height: 460px; position: relative; transform: rotate(-0.5deg);\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0 27px, #aacbe8 27px 28px), #fdf9c4;\n    border-radius: 3px 10px 10px 3px;\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.5), 0 2px 0 #d9c46a, 0 3px 0 #cbb558, 4px 0 0 #e8dfae;\n    padding: 34px 28px 40px 72px; }\n  .pad::before { /* red margin line */\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 52px; width: 1px;\n    background: #e08a8a; box-shadow: 2px 0 0 #e08a8a; }\n  .pad::after { /* stitching */\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 7px; border: 1.5px dashed rgba(160, 140, 60, 0.55); border-radius: 3px; pointer-events: none; }\n  .pin { position: absolute; top: -13px; left: 50%; margin-left: -16px; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, #ff9d9d, #d02f2f 55%, #8f1414);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 10px rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.5), inset 0 -3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .pad .date { position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 22px; font-size: 11px; color: #a59a5c; font-style: italic; }\n  .writing { font-family: \"Marker Felt\", \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", cursive; color: #2b3a55;\n    font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; min-height: 380px; outline: none; caret-color: #d02f2f; }\n  .writing:empty::before { content: \"Write something…\"; color: #b3ab7a; }\n  .wordcount { text-align: right; font-size: 10.5px; color: #a59a5c; font-style: italic; padding: 8px 4px 0; }\n\n  .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 16px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14); border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"app\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"topbar\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"title\">Notes \u003csmall>Local Storage Edition\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"gloss\" id=\"newBtn\">＋ New Note\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cols\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"list\" id=\"list\">\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"padwrap\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pad\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"pin\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"date\" id=\"padDate\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"writing\" id=\"writing\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"wordcount\" id=\"wc\">0 words\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"toolbar\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"gloss red\" id=\"delBtn\">🗑 Delete Note\u003c/button>\n      \u003cspan style=\"color:#cfd9e8;font-size:11px;margin-left:auto;opacity:0.8\">Notes are saved in your browser automatically\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const KEY = \"skeuo.notes\";\n    let notes, sel;\n    try { notes = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY) || \"null\") || null; } catch (e) { notes = null; }\n    if (!notes) {\n      notes = [\n        { id: 1, t: \"Grocery list\", d: \"2026-10-10\", b: \"pick up after work:\u003cbr>• milk\u003cbr>• bread\u003cbr>• gummy frogs (important)\" },\n        { id: 2, t: \"Design ideas\", d: \"2026-10-11\", b: \"what if buttons looked like REAL buttons?\u003cbr>\u003cbr>• gloss highlights\u003cbr>• pixel-perfect bevels\u003cbr>• shadows you can feel\" }\n      ];\n      sel = 1;\n    } else { sel = notes[0].id; }\n    function save() { try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(notes)); } catch (e) {} }\n    function fmtDate(s) { const d = new Date(s); return isNaN(d) ? s : d.toDateString().slice(4); }\n\n    const list = document.getElementById(\"list\"), writing = document.getElementById(\"writing\");\n    function render() {\n      document.getElementById(\"list\").innerHTML = notes.map(n =>\n        '\u003cdiv class=\"note-item' + (n.id === sel ? \" sel\" : \"\") + '\" data-id=\"' + n.id + '\">' +\n        '\u003cdiv class=\"t\">' + n.t + \"\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\" + '\"d\">' + fmtDate(n.d) + \"\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\").join(\"\");\n      const note = notes.find(n => n.id === sel);\n      writing.innerHTML = note ? note.b : \"\";\n      document.getElementById(\"padDate\").textContent = note ? fmtDate(note.d) : \"\";\n      wc();\n      list.querySelectorAll(\".note-item\").forEach(el => el.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        sel = +el.dataset.id; save(); render();\n      }));\n    }\n    function wc() {\n      const words = (writing.textContent.trim().match(/\\S+/g) || []).length;\n      document.getElementById(\"wc\").textContent = words + (words === 1 ? \" word\" : \" words\");\n    }\n    writing.addEventListener(\"input\", () => {\n      const note = notes.find(n => n.id === sel);\n      if (!note) return;\n      note.b = writing.innerHTML;\n      note.t = (writing.textContent.trim().split(\"\\n\")[0] || \"New Note\").slice(0, 32);\n      note.d = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n      save();\n      const item = list.querySelector('.note-item[data-id=\"' + sel + '\"] .t');\n      if (item) item.textContent = note.t;\n      wc();\n    });\n    document.getElementById(\"newBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      const id = Date.now();\n      notes.unshift({ id: id, t: \"New Note\", d: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10), b: \"\" });\n      sel = id; save(); render(); writing.focus();\n    });\n    document.getElementById(\"delBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (!confirm(\"Delete this note?\")) return;\n      notes = notes.filter(n => n.id !== sel);\n      sel = notes.length ? notes[0].id : null;\n      if (!notes.length) notes = [{ id: Date.now(), t: \"New Note\", d: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10), b: \"\" }], sel = notes[0].id;\n      save(); render();\n    });\n    document.getElementById(\"padDate\").textContent = new Date().toDateString().slice(4);\n    render();\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}